      "headline": "Senior Software Engineer at Medtronic",
      "about": "Senior Software Engineer (SDET) with 11+ years of experience in Automation Testing across Healthcare and Telecom domains.\n\nCurrently working at Medtronic on safety-critical medical device platforms, contributing to quality assurance of Remote Patient Monitoring (RPM) systems used by clinicians globally.\n\nMy expertise includes designing, enhancing, and owning large-scale automation frameworks using SpecFlow (BDD), Selenium, C#, and CI/CD pipelines. I have strong experience in driving regression automation at scale, reducing execution timelines, and supporting release sign-offs in Agile environments.\n\nKey highlights:\n• Automated 5,000+ test cases across multiple product modules\n• Supported 30,000+ regression test executions via CI/CD\n• Reduced manual testing effort by ~80%\n• Reduced regression cycle from 1 week to ~1 day\n• Strong experience in Azure DevOps pipelines and Git\n• API testing using Postman\n• Performance testing exposure using NBomber (PoC) and JMeter\n\nI enjoy working in product-focused environments where quality, reliability, and ownership matter.\n\nCurrently open to Senior SDET / Automation Engineer opportunities in Hyderabad or Remote roles.",
